<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox cut to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers downgraded Xerox Corp to outperform from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 48-7/8 Friday.  </p>
<p>-- In a report, Lehman analyst Theodor Kundtz cited the company's disappointing quarterly earnings report on Friday.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Digital B&amp;W products, color products and outsourcing still demonstrating rapid growth, but without modest growth in core B&amp;W business, it is unlikely that Xerox can achieve earlier top-line growth target,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
